{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1211797-first-pulse-style-lunar-or-infernal-book","id":1211797,"title":"First Pulse Style - Lunar or Infernal book?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-26T07:45:53-07:00","id":1211797,"title":"First Pulse Style - Lunar or Infernal book?","content":"Anyone remember First Pulse Style?<br /> <br /> Strip away the Second Edition idea that the style is Air-aspected, and what you still have is a pure street-fighting Style. It is a \u201cmean streets, urban jungle\u201d Style. It has bare-knuckles pugilism, bellow-the-belt punching, sand-in-eye throwing, thumb-in-eye gouging, and literal curb-stomping. It\u2019s ugly and vicious and ruthlessly, efficiently practical.<br /> <br /> It\u2019s perfect for the Lunar book. There can\u2019t be a better Style for street-rats who are Chosen by Luna.<br /> <br /> The only splat more perfect for this Style would be Infernals, who can\u2019t keep Infernal Monster Style as a Martial Art rather than native Brawl Charms. Infernal Monster was practically the big brother of First Pulse Style.<br /> <br /> And who else better for \u201cmean streets, urban jungle\u201d than the Chosen of the Demon City?<br /> <br /> What do you think?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-26T07:52:55-07:00","id":1211801,"title":"","content":"Honestly, I hope Infernals book has Martial Arts centered on demonic originated or weird esoteric forbidden arts, instead of 'just' utter ruthlessness.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-26T07:58:01-07:00","id":1211803,"title":"","content":"I'm not eager to wait until the infernal book to see first pulse style. If it is going to be transferred to 3rd edition, I hope it is in the lunar book (now that my original hope, that it become a branch of the dragonblooded brawl tree, is not going to happen).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I want to play <a href=\"https://forum.atlas-games.com/t/adelbert-a-magi-of-hermes-look-at-intellego-and-astrology/8146/382\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> as a starting character, I don't even care what game.","edited":{"userid":872,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/872-apromor","user":"Apromor","date":". 04-26-2018, 11:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/872-apromor","name":"Apromor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar872_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"245"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-26T13:06:17-07:00","id":1211949,"title":"","content":"I've always thought of First Pulse as Martial Arts trying too hard to be Brawl. Since we have Brawl, we don't need it; just about everything its Charms do can just be turned into a gambit for general use.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-26T13:27:03-07:00","id":1211955,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1211797-first-pulse-style-lunar-or-infernal-book?p=1211949#post1211949\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've always thought of First Pulse as Martial Arts trying too hard to be Brawl. Since we have Brawl, we don't need it; just about everything its Charms do can just be turned into a gambit for general use.</div> </div> </div> </div>I started having second thoughts along those lines, too.<br /> <br /> I was thinking about those street-rat orphan fighters and said to myself, \u201cDoes it really make sense that you\u2019d represent their combat skill with a Martial Arts Ability rather than Brawl?\u201d<br /> <br /> That question didn\u2019t exist back in Second Edition, where there was only one Martial Arts Ability for everything, including Brawl.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-26T14:00:08-07:00","id":1211965,"title":"","content":"Personally, I wish they'd just have the brawl charms in the splats and release other Martial Arts styles in their own PDFs, ala the HDNP or AotR supplements. I'd pay a few bucks for an MA style on it's own. and this may be the best way to release stuff in 3E, since most books seem to take a while to make it to publishing, <br /> <br /> whatever they do, I hope they get to First Pulse soon. I had a solar I wanted to make who's style of fighting would be MMA/Street Fight and thsi would be the best style for her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-26T20:09:35-07:00","id":1212117,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1211797-first-pulse-style-lunar-or-infernal-book?p=1211965#post1211965\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Personally, I wish they'd just have the brawl charms in the splats and release other Martial Arts styles in their own PDFs, ala the HDNP or AotR supplements. I'd pay a few bucks for an MA style on it's own. and this may be the best way to release stuff in 3E, since most books seem to take a while to make it to publishing,<br /> <br /> whatever they do, I hope they get to First Pulse soon. I had a solar I wanted to make who's style of fighting would be MMA/Street Fight and thsi would be the best style for her.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> They've mentioned doing an MA focused and Sorcerey focused book before.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-26T21:21:37-07:00","id":1212138,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1211797-first-pulse-style-lunar-or-infernal-book?p=1212117#post1212117\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> They've mentioned doing an MA focused and Sorcerey focused book before.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, they pretty much have to at some point. We have what, 4 solar circle spells right now? I know it lets you do better workings as well but still.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-27T04:21:55-07:00","id":1212211,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1211797-first-pulse-style-lunar-or-infernal-book?p=1211965#post1211965\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">whatever they do, I hope they get to First Pulse soon. I had a solar I wanted to make who's style of fighting would be MMA/Street Fight and thsi would be the best style for her.</div> </div> </div> </div>Saur Ops raises a valid point, though: What does First Pulse Style do that Brawl Charms and gambits don't?<br /> <br /> Solar Brawl has Thunderclap Rush Technique for striking first, Ox-Stunning Punch for suckerpunching the poor sap you rushed, Falling Hammer Strike for making sure his stunning and onslaught penalties never go away, Heaven Thunder Hammer for smashing him into the ground beneath you so hard he takes falling damage and is rendered prone...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}